Privacy Policy for DocuParse

DocuParse respects your privacy. This app is designed to work entirely offline and does not require an internet connection.

No Data Collection: DocuParse does not collect, store, or share any personal information.

Offline Usage: All document processing, including PDF conversion, OCR, and text extraction, happens locally on your device.

No Third-Party Services: The app does not use analytics, ads, or third-party tracking services.

User Control: All data processed by DocuParse stays on your device. You have full control over your documents.

By using DocuParse, you agree that your data remains private and secure on your device.
